tw.com/post/%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%87%91%E9%AB%AE%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</link><pubDate>Sat, 25 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E7%8D%85%E5%AD%90%E5%BA%A7%E5%AE%88%E8%AD%B7%E6%B0%B4%E6%99%B6%E5%AE%8C%E6%95%B4%E6%8C%87%E5%8D%97%E9%87%91%E9%AB%AE%E6%99%B6%E8%88%87%E5%A4%AA%E9%99%BD%E7%9F%B3%E7%9A%84%E8%83%BD%E9%87%8F%E6%90%AD%E9%85%8D/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;獅子座守護石是什麼？本站以金髮晶為主石，太陽石為輔助石，對應自信與溫暖的文化意象。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>